\newlabel{fig:binary_certification}{{4}{19}{Exact binomial operating characteristics of the local submodel, with $p=0.1$, $d=0.2$ and certification error 0.05. (A) Harmful selection at $\theta =0$. (B) Positive borrowing at $\theta =0.04$. All values are exact binomial sums; the two lower-bound rules have distinct power despite controlling error}{figure.caption.4}{}}
