\newlabel{fig:epa_budget}{{6}{25}{Reference-budget and upper-tail precision under random auditing. (A) Width ratios averaged across humidity within each mask, with $\pm 1.96$ Monte Carlo standard errors. (B) Paired's correct sign resolution at concentration 15, with exact binomial 95\% intervals; the dotted line is 0.80. Budgets 5--20\% use the original 200 masks and budgets 40--95\% use 400 masks. Draw families are nested across budgets; historical training costs are additional}{figure.caption.6}{}}
